title: "Robust minimum-divergence estimation of point-process intensities — replication package"
abstract: "Code and manuscript for a weighted-intensity (density-power-divergence) M-estimator of point-process intensities, with a martingale central limit theorem, an efficiency–robustness frontier, and renewal/inhomogeneous-Poisson/Hawkes examples."
